NO WARRANTY. This is an MCP server: it reports market data, computed indicators
and account reads over a read-only connection to a futures brokerage gateway. It
has no order path and places no trades. Its risk is in what it reports rather
than in what it does, because a figure that is subtly wrong looks exactly like
one that is right and is acted on by whoever reads it. It is provided on an
